  << /ActualText (I\047m a recent Sociology graduate with hands\055on experience in project coordination\054 event planning\054 team leadership\054 community engagement and event promotion\056\n\nMost of my experience has come from building things with people\072 planning events\054 coordinating teams\054 working with vendors and stakeholders\054 promoting experiences\054 solving problems and making sure plans actually come together\056\n\nI enjoy the part of a project that happens between the idea and the final experience\072 creating structure\054 getting people aligned\054 following up on details and figuring things out when things don\047t go exactly according to plan\056)
